From 921336643bd404d4c1d69e8008781fa087a0958e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:21:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD Vim visual copy mode so terminal panes can copy
 focused text

Terminal command mode supports character, line, and block visual selections in the focused pane, with Vim-style movement and OSC 52 clipboard output. Escape-sequence handling keeps bytewise arrow-key input inside visual mode so terminal CSI prefixes do not cancel the selection before movement is applied.
